		{"id":"legend","type":"text","text":"## How to read this\n**Higher boxes use lower boxes.** Arrows point at the thing being used.\nInside the green group, layers ≠ registration order (see [[Application and Subsystems]]).\n🔴 **Red arrow = dependency cycle** (points upward).\n\nStart: [[Engine Map]] · Adding something? [[Where Things Go]]","x":600,"y":-1120,"width":540,"height":290,"color":"3"}
